  "question": {
    "text": "A man crosses a river in a boat. If he crosses the river in minimum time, he takes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mi>min</mi></math> with a drift <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>120</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. If he crosses the river taking the shortest path, he takes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>min</mi></math>, find the width of the river.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Oai9m",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>215</mn><mo>&#xA0;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "2JgWk",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>150</mn><mo>&#xA0;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Mbtzk",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#xA0;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "25nWb",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&#xA0;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></math> = velocity of river<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>br</mi></msub></math> = velocity of river in still water and<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>w</mi></math> = width of river<br /><br />Given,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>min</mi></math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>w</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>br</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;...(i)<br /><br />Drift, in this case, will be,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mi>t</mi></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>120</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;...(ii)<br /><br /><b><u><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0027186_Ans_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 279px; height: 150px;\" /></u></b><br /><br /><b><u><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0027186_Ans_2.jpg\" style=\"width: 243px; height: 157px;\" /></u></b><br /><br />The shortest path is taken when v<sub>b</sub> is along <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AB</mi></math>. In this case,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>b</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mtext>br</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></msqrt></math><br /><br />Now,&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn><mtext>.</mtext><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>w</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mtext>b</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>w</mi><msqrt><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mtext>br</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mtext>r</mtext><mn>2</mn></msubsup></msqrt></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;...(iii)<br /><br />Solving these three equations, we get<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>br</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>min</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>min</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />and&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>",
    "image": null
  },
